#: ../../index.md:3 2ac8f145e55e4a92bf8875fb16f9fe27
msgid "A workbench for pricing options and swaps against a **live QuantLib object graph**. The graph lives in a C++ service (`ql-backend`); this app is the browser front end that authors a market, authors a trade, and asks for prices over a binary WebSocket."
msgstr "一套以 **QuantLib 即時物件圖** 為後盾的選擇權與交換合約定價工作台。物件圖存在於 C++ 服務（`ql-backend`）之中；本應用程式是瀏覽器前端，負責編寫市場、編寫交易，並透過二進位 WebSocket 索取價格。"

#: ../../index.md:8 c17d47ba8ec34cdba69f7f2fdf402be8
msgid "The thing that makes it different from a calculator is the word *live*. A session on the service holds the built graph between requests, so moving a quote reprices only what depends on that quote — no rebuild, no re-parse, one round trip. Everything in the interface follows from that one fact, and so does most of this guide."
msgstr "讓它不同於一般計算機的關鍵字是**即時**。服務上的工作階段會在多次請求之間保留已建好的物件圖，因此改動一筆報價時，只有依賴該報價的部分會重新計價——不重建、不重新解析，只有一次往返。介面上的一切都由這個事實推導而來，本說明書的大部分內容也是。"

#: ../../index.md:14 c5ab0e2a2e76427884e4cda9ff621e01
msgid "The browser holds the workbook and sends one binary ClientFrame per request over a WebSocket; ql-backend holds the session, a live QuantLib object graph built once and held between requests; QuantLib prices against it and answers with the NPV and the greeks."
msgstr "瀏覽器持有工作簿，每個請求透過 WebSocket 送出一個二進位 ClientFrame；ql-backend 持有工作階段，也就是建好一次、在請求之間保留的 QuantLib 即時物件圖；QuantLib 據此計價，回覆淨現值與希臘字母。"

#: ../../index.md:18 77c78135070a4020805fd74f0c28c568
msgid "Three layers, and one message each way between the first two. What the browser owns is the *document*; what the service owns is the *graph*."
msgstr "三層架構，前兩層之間每個方向各一則訊息。瀏覽器擁有的是**文件**，服務擁有的是**物件圖**。"

#: ../../index.md:57 6090d0f853594e82aeeae1e97c1d512d
msgid "What this build prices"
msgstr "這個版本能計價什麼"

#: ../../index.md:59 c9c32c59072d4493b2b43df787a86e98
msgid "Ten option styles — vanilla, barrier, double barrier, Asian, lookback, forward start, compound, chooser, cliquet and the multi-asset basket — over eight payoffs and three exercise types, with quanto composing over four of the styles, plus an *n*-leg fixed-against-Ibor swap. Behind them are 49 distinct compiled engines across six methods: analytic, lattice, finite difference, Monte Carlo, integral and discounting."
msgstr "十種選擇權類型——一般型、障礙、雙障礙、亞式、回顧式、遠期起始、複合式、選擇者、棘輪式與多標的一籃子——搭配八種收益函數與三種履約方式，其中四種類型可再疊加 quanto（匯率連動），另有 *n* 腳的固定對 Ibor 利率交換。這些背後是六種方法共 49 個各自編譯出來的定價引擎：解析解、格點、有限差分、蒙地卡羅、數值積分與折現。"

#: ../../index.md:66 13e2772f4c4342dfb3bbd2fd9264fb8c
msgid "That list is not a promise this guide makes on the service's behalf. The service publishes it: the client asks `Hello` on connect and the answer is a `Capabilities` frame naming every style, payoff, tree, preset and result kind this build actually dispatches. The interface greys out everything outside it and says why, and a badge appears in the status bar if the two ever disagree."
msgstr "這份清單不是本說明書代服務所做的承諾，而是服務自己公布的：用戶端連線時送出 `Hello`，服務以 `Capabilities` 訊框回覆，逐一列出這個版本實際會派工的每一種類型、收益函數、樹、預設格點與結果種類。介面會把清單以外的選項變灰並說明原因；兩邊一旦不一致，狀態列就會出現徽章。"

